# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. This is the #4914 deadlock: the reparent callback is not [AlwaysInterleave].
MODULE: SetParentQueuedBehindTurn
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SetParentAsync queues behind the leaf's running turn (#4914)
PERTURBS: AdmitSetParent

--- FIND
    /\ Admits(l, SetParentInterleaves)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: SetParentAsync is not [AlwaysInterleave]
    /\ Admits(l, FALSE)
--- END
